                  <a id="chatPartnerEmail" href="#" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-canvas-soft hover:bg-primary-pale text-ink flex items-center justify-center transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:outline-none" title="Email partner">✉️</a>
